    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="1796d255-030d-579e-afa0-10085b996ff1" activityNameId="4691bb3e-31d9-55ef-a765-9978f873d728" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sawmill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sawmill
The service life is assumed to be 50 years. Thus the life time output is 2'500'000 m3 sawn timber. This data must only be used to consider the infrastructure needed for sawing wood if this is not relevant.;
Synonyms: Sägewerk, sawing mill; 
UUID: 81ead69a-19fa-3512-8683-2f1779975d42
The land area and the material and their transports needed for building and disposal of a sawmill with a yearly output of 50"000 m3 sawn timber is included. Land used for air drying of wood is not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Sawmill with it"s input wood storage place, a lop station, a hall with the saw and a conveyer belt.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: estimation 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_81ead69a-19fa-3512-8683-2f1779975d42.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
